1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:04,960
Earth—

2
00:00:04,960 --> 00:00:08,359
What are you doing?

3
00:00:11,320 --> 00:00:15,759
Hey, sit here first.

4
00:00:22,080 --> 00:00:28,880
Is something wrong? If something's bothering you,
just tell me. I want to help.

5
00:00:28,880 --> 00:00:31,359
I really do.

6
00:00:32,840 --> 00:00:39,079
Then… can you help me with something?

7
00:00:39,480 --> 00:00:46,440
Can I stay with you for a while?

8
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:00,719
Of course. If Earth asks,
I'll give you anything.

9
00:01:00,719 --> 00:01:03,208
Do you want something to drink?
I'll treat you.

10
00:01:05,784 --> 00:01:07,307
No… I'm okay.

11
00:01:07,307 --> 00:01:12,281
It's fine, I'll order for you.
Let's go with—

12
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:16,642
Whiskey Sour.

13
00:01:18,735 --> 00:01:22,636
Life may be bitter,
but there's sweetness hidden in it.

14
00:01:22,663 --> 00:01:25,589
Suits you well, Earth.

15
00:01:25,589 --> 00:01:28,600
Okay.

16
00:01:38,320 --> 00:01:42,240
Come on in.

17
00:01:43,640 --> 00:01:47,903
Just put your bags around here.
No need to be shy.

18
00:01:54,826 --> 00:01:57,999
This is the bedroom.
I already set it up.

19
00:02:02,520 --> 00:02:06,167
Uh…
Will this really be okay?

20
00:02:07,419 --> 00:02:12,474
Hmm?
Are you disgusted by me?

21
00:02:12,617 --> 00:02:17,772
No… I just don't know
if doing this is really a good idea.

22
00:02:19,454 --> 00:02:22,108
But you're the one
who asked to stay with me.
